=3D"Click to copy link"><i class=3D"fi fi-link"></i></a></h2>
      <p>This section defines the actors, transactions, and/or content modu=
les in this profile. General definitions of actors are given in the <a href=
=3D"http://profiles.ihe.net/GeneralIntro/ch-A.html">Technical Frameworks Ge=
neral Introduction Appendix A at</a>
      </p>
